  "interactables": [{"at":{"x":82,"y":0,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2597","text":"Access to Lower Floors"},{"at":{"x":75,"y":1,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2602","text":"Teleportation Research Lab"},{"at":{"x":85,"y":1,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2597","text":"Time and Space Research Lab"},{"at":{"x":38,"y":2,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2597","text":"WARNING! Monsters down the hole!"},{"at":{"x":87,"y":5,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2597","text":"Freeze Research Lab\nKeep the door closed!\nOnly enter with adequately warm clothing!"},{"at":{"x":89,"y":5,"z":8},"kind":"locked-door","initialState":"locked","appearanceKey":"locked-door-7034"},{"at":{"x":62,"y":12,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-6121","text":"IRKM DESMET DAEM"},{"at":{"x":33,"y":16,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2012","text":"DANGER!\nInfested by Bugs and Spiders!\nOnly experienced adventurers should proceed!"},{"at":{"x":73,"y":18,"z":8},"kind":"locked-door","initialState":"open","appearanceKey":"locked-door-7715"},{"at":{"x":74,"y":18,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2597","text":"Academy and Training Centre\nFeel free to explore our research! Please do not touch exhibits."},{"at":{"x":75,"y":19,"z":8},"kind":"chest","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"chest-2473","aid":2000,"uid":64129},{"at":{"x":85,"y":20,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2602","text":"This chest has an interval. If you lose the quest items inside, you can come back in one day and open\nthe chest again.\nIt's not normal in Tibia that you can easily get back quest items if you lose them, so pay attention and don't\ndrop them!"},{"at":{"x":77,"y":21,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2597","text":"You cannot actually sleep in these beds here. To regain hitpoints, you have to eat food or use health\npotions to heal yourself. However once you've left Rookgaard, it's possible to rent and decorate a little house\nof your own in which you can spend the night."},{"at":{"x":87,"y":21,"z":8},"kind":"quest-door","initialState":"closed","appearanceKey":"quest-door-5104"},{"at":{"x":91,"y":21,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2597","text":"This is a bank. \nSay \"hi\" to Paulie if you want to \"deposit all\" money you're carrying with you - that way it's safely stored and\nyou won't lose it if something happens to you.\nYou can also \"withdraw\" money if you need to buy something, or check your \"balance\" if you want to see how\nmuch you've already deposited."},{"at":{"x":83,"y":22,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-5372","text":"Bank and Trade Room"},{"at":{"x":82,"y":26,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2602","text":"This is a trade room.\nIf you want to safetrade with another player, right-click on the item you want to trade and select \"trade with\".\nThen, left-click on the character you want to trade with. If he or she did the same, a new window opens in which\nyou can see both sides of the offer. Click \"Ok\" to accept or \"Cancel\" if you don't like the deal.\nYou can safetrade anywhere! But in this trade room it's safe to show your goods to each other if you're\nstanding on one of the orange floor "},{"at":{"x":76,"y":36,"z":8},"kind":"lever","initialState":"down","appearanceKey":"lever","aid":50239},{"at":{"x":82,"y":36,"z":8},"kind":"lever","initialState":"down","appearanceKey":"lever","aid":50239},{"at":{"x":29,"y":41,"z":8},"kind":"sign","initialState":"default","appearanceKey":"sign-2012","text":"DANGER!\nOnly experienced adventurers should proceed from here."}],
